<title>FRANCE: French unemployment fell in July -- minister.</title>
<headline>French unemployment fell in July -- minister.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>French unemployment fell in July, Labour and Social Affairs Minister Jacques Barrot said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a fall in unemployment. You will see,&quot; Barrot told Europe 1 radio. But he declined to give a figure ahead of the official release of the unemployment figures at 0645 GMT.</p>
<p>Earlier, Liberation newspaper reported that unemployment fell slightly in July.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
